[{"client_msg_id":"b94afc17-319c-4413-b0f3-bc72d7a2fe81","type":"message","user":"U02EDJVQJ9X","text":"接種券取れるかな","ts":"1635309351.050300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZXX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6dbe5de0-6ad7-4936-bf93-11aa0b82b82b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"半年以内くらいに３回目接種できそう \u003chttps://lifevancouver.jp/2021/10/news/200556.html\u003e","ts":"1635308681.049700","attachments":[{"fallback":"2022年5月までに全BC州民はCovid-19ワクチンのブースター接種が可能に","id":1,"title":"2022年5月までに全BC州民はCovid-19ワクチンのブースター接種が可能に","title_link":"https://lifevancouver.jp/2021/10/news/200556.html","text":"BC州政府は今後BC州民に対して、Covid-19のブースターショットが利用可能になることを発表しました。2021年の年末までは、免疫不全の人々や長期介護施設の居住者などワクチンの追加接種が特に必要な人たちへ3回目のCovid-19ワクチンが投与される予定ですが、2022年1月から一般へのブースター接種が開始されます。","image_url":"https://lifevancouver.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/booster-1024x538.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"lifevancouver.jp","service_icon":"https://lifevancouver.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://lifevancouver.jp/2021/10/news/200556.html","original_url":"https://lifevancouver.jp/2021/10/news/200556.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mYYlZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a71a401-f13f-4c11-a981-cc5374fdfd84","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"HITTは気合が必要","ts":"1635306017.049300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OaE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8d025da-ff3a-4130-b9b1-9ad17c1bfe0b","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"HIITしんどくて….","ts":"1635305927.048400","edited":{"user":"UD1FQV38V","ts":"1635305938.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kKVS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0a52f8e-1cf2-4eb9-868d-740b915e0cc6","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"High-Intensity vIm Training","ts":"1635305875.047300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"vimvim","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"quick_alisue","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4B6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc70e553-5cc1-4937-ab4a-6368d3257057","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"私はHIITを2ヶ月休みなしで続けた辺りから腹筋が割れましたね(個人差は多分あります)","ts":"1635305820.046800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rhkD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2a4051f-c4ba-48fc-8e2f-034b00b47764","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"HIITやればええんですよ","ts":"1635305769.045800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VibZJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94b4d035-3c64-4ef1-a864-25fb4a086fb6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ここ1年くらい、1回も腹筋したことない。","ts":"1635305662.045400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sh2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb3cb22b-7ca4-4c02-af60-c6c0eb20687c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"とどのつまり減量ですが、それがしんどい","ts":"1635305485.045000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LqS4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"644ea195-202a-4269-9238-766f52df31ce","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あと筋肉量もあると思うので、筋肉をつけて脂肪を落とす\nそういう食事とトレーニングをやらないと割れた腹筋は見えないので、難易度が高い。。。","ts":"1635305390.043900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GkT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"612ebc5c-a072-48b9-9f1d-3ceacf0ec9ba","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"筋トレで腹筋は割れますが、割れた腹筋が見えるようにするには、脂肪を落とさないと行けないのでカロリー制限というより脂肪を落とす食事をする必要があると思います","ts":"1635305312.042700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aXpI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c0a8276-3a1b-4e20-85b8-3a10a7e18b1e","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"2年やってようやく薄っすらと割れてきました","ts":"1635301484.041300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"slow-loris","count":2,"users":["U72TB62UF","UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U02EDJVQJ9X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yeq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e9f131f-838a-4792-bd0b-74672a3cad95","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"筋肉が付きつつ、腹の脂肪が薄くないと、「割れた」のが見えることはないらしいので、両方でしょうねえ(筋肉へろへろでもガリガリだと割れるけど、それは別)","ts":"1635300947.040900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Si7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8c70c91-3081-4f30-9ca1-53c8695fc51b","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"腹筋割るの、カロリー制限派と筋トレ派の両方がいて、どちらを信じるべきか悩ましい。\nたぶん両立しなさいが答えという気がする。","ts":"1635300849.039900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"02U1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5cf19c6-6fe4-4301-a926-6bfb5e3c031c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"これきつかった","ts":"1635299826.038700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xY="}]},{"client_msg_id":"30c2dd5b-9671-4725-abe7-4d5ef4625130","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U4HAtzNCbx8\u003e","ts":"1635299822.038400","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: 実はこの1種目だけで腹筋は割れます","id":1,"author_name":"バズーカ岡田の筋トレラボ","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrV1T0LCGPgGiBspaL2pZHw","title":"実はこの1種目だけで腹筋は割れます","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U4HAtzNCbx8","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/U4HAtzNCbx8/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\